 "lead": 2,
 "id": "TokenSeven",
 "slug": "token-seven",
 "topic": "How did these 7 players find the Golden Token? (16:9 countdown, blocky style, invented game)",
 "title": [
  "HOW 7 PLAYERS FOUND",
  "THE GOLDEN TOKEN"
 ],
 "accent": "TOKEN",
 "gap": 0.1,
 "tempo": 1.1,
 "script": [
  {
   "beat": "s",
   "text": "Only seven players in the whole world have found the Golden Token in Block Quest."
  },
  {
   "beat": "s",
   "text": "And how they did it? Nobody tells you. Until now."
  },
  {
   "beat": "s",
   "text": "Number seven. Mia. She didn't find it. Her cat did. It walked across the keyboard, and jumped straight into a hidden cave."
  },
  {
   "beat": "s",
   "text": "Number six. Leo. He fell asleep on the jump button. Four hours later, his character had bounced all the way up to the token."
  },
  {
   "beat": "s",
   "text": "Number five. Grandpa Joe. He thought the game was a crossword. So he typed gold in the chat. That was the secret code."
  },
  {
   "beat": "s",
   "text": "Number four. The twins. One of them played with the screen upside down. Turns out, the map only makes sense that way."
  },
  {
   "beat": "s",
   "text": "Number three. Max. He lost a thousand times in a row. The game felt so sorry for him, it just gave him the token."
  },
  {
   "beat": "s",
   "text": "Number two. A baby. Nobody knows how. Nobody."
  },
  {
   "beat": "s",
   "text": "And number one. You. Because here's the truth no one tells you."
  },
  {
   "beat": "s",
   "text": "The token was never hidden. It's been sitting behind the start button the whole time."
  },
  {
   "beat": "s",
   "text": "Go check. And comment token if you found it."
  }
 ],
